# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Teaches: tidal slime. The flat floods and drains in a wave that rolls toward you;
# dry ground bubbles just before it floods. A straight dash drowns: wait on the
# start and on each island for the tide to turn. The gutters either side never drain.
